    "BatchPlanCompositionRoot": {
      "action": "add",
      "docs": "Composition root for the batch-plan command family: constructs the batch-plan reader, planned-task reader, scope-config reader and branch-reader adapters, injects the resolve interactor and those readers into the gate interactor, and hands that single service to the driver. Type-design: construction and injection only — it declares no adapter of its own, so no port implementation lives in this layer. Pure DI: batch_plan_driver takes no argument and returns no error, because the items directory travels with the driver input and each adapter resolves paths per call. IN-06, AC-06.",
